{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-gate-royale-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"gate-royale-residences-baron-development-jebel-ali-village","about":"Gate Royale Residences is an exclusive residential development by Baron Development, set within the tranquil yet connected enclave of Jebel Ali Village, Dubai. Rising 11 floors above ground and offering just 60 premium residences, this low-density project delivers a boutique living experience. Designed to meet the needs of modern families and professionals, the project features a selection of 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, along with spacious 3-bedroom duplexes.With attractive prices and just a 10% down payment, Gate Royale Residences presents an accessible opportunity in one of Dubai’s established communities. The project combines refined architectural design, efficient floor plans, and a prime location near key transport routes—offering both lifestyle appeal and long-term investment value. Whether for end-use or leasing potential, the residences cater to a sophisticated buyer seeking quality, comfort, and future growth.","price":949000,"title":"Gate Royale Residences","bitrix":{"id":1202,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Gate Royale Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Gate Royale Residences","property_type":"Apartments","developer_name":"Baron Development","project_location":"Jebel Ali"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gate_Royale_Residences_by_Baron_Development_in_Dubai_be37f7dc0b.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Gate_Royale_Residences_by_Baron_Development_in_Dubai_be37f7dc0b.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0374773,"lng":55.1316832},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gate_Royale_Residences_by_Baron_Development_in_Dubai_36c35d235e.webp","464x312":"https://d3h3